# Figoya Website — Organisational Intelligence

This is the extremely lightweight website for figoya.com

This website should be minimalist

1. Minimal code - the lightest website in the world
2. Minimal effort for the user to understand our message

This website should explain the problem

- Current AI is brilliant at creating text, but careless with facts — and organisational knowledge has no compiler

This website should explain our solution

- Figoya is the organisational-intelligence platform: a claim graph with lineage, so professionals get answers they can stand behind

Copy source of truth: website-copy.md (v2, 2026-08-31). Code conventions: semantic HTML,
.s/.c class system, per-section CSS under _/css/section/, per-page CSS under _/css/page/,
low-carbon-state-manager for events/state. Type: Montserrat (variable, self-hosted, one woff2).
